          "signature": "theorem continuedEntry_initial (N : ℕ) [NeZero N] (hN : 0 < N) (g h : SL(2,ℤ))\n    (s : ℂ) (hs : 1 < s.re) : continuedEntry N hN g h s = scatteringEntry N g h s"
